<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="bg">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>АПОСТИЛ, преводи и легализация, демо</title>
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0e1f52">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--navy:#1b3786;--navy2:#142a6b;--navy3:#0e1f52;--red:#e02b20;--red2:#c4231a;--ink:#14192b;--ink2:#51596e;--soft:#f4f6fa;--line:#d9deea;--green:#1f8a55;--t:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;--r:8px}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:100px}
body{margin:0;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.65 var(--t);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:clip}
h1,h2,h3,h4,p{margin:0}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}img{display:block;max-width:100%}
a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible,select:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--red);outline-offset:3px}
.wrap{width:min(1180px,100% - 48px);margin-inline:auto}
.ic{width:1.1em;height:1.1em;flex:none;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
/* bars */
.strip{background:#080f2b;color:rgba(255,255,255,.82);font-size:12.5px;text-align:center;padding:7px 16px}
.strip b{color:#fff;font-weight:600}
.util{background:var(--soft);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink2)}
.util .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:8px 0}
.util span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-right:22px}
.util .ic{color:var(--red)}
.util .r span:last-child{margin-right:0}
@media(max-width:700px){.util .l{display:none}.util .wrap{justify-content:center}}
.hd{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.hd .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;min-height:78px}
.hd img{height:46px;width:auto}
.nl{display:flex;gap:2px;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.nl a{display:block;padding:12px 16px;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);border-bottom:2px solid transparent}
.nl a:hover{color:var(--navy);border-bottom-color:var(--red)}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;padding:14px 26px;border-radius:var(--r);font:700 14px var(--t);letter-spacing:.03em;cursor:pointer;border:2px solid transparent;transition:background .2s,color .2s,border-color .2s,transform .2s}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px)}
.b1{background:var(--red);color:#fff;border-color:var(--red)}
.b1:hover{background:var(--red2);border-color:var(--red2)}
.b2{background:#fff;color:var(--navy);border-color:var(--navy)}
.b2:hover{background:var(--navy);color:#fff}
.b3{background:transparent;color:#fff;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.7)}
.b3:hover{background:#fff;color:var(--navy)}
.hd .btn{padding:11px 22px;font-size:13.5px}
@media(max-width:900px){.nl{display:none}}
/* hero */
.hero{position:relative;background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--navy3) 0%,var(--navy2) 55%,var(--navy) 100%);color:#fff;overflow:hidden}
.hero::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,255,255,.035) 0 1px,transparent 1px 26px);pointer-events:none}
.hero::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;height:4px;background:var(--red)}
.hg{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:clamp(32px,6vw,80px);align-items:center;padding:clamp(52px,7vw,100px) 0}
@media(max-width:960px){.hg{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.eb{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--red)}
.eb::before{content:"";width:28px;height:2px;background:currentColor}
.hero .eb{color:#ff9a92}
h1{font-size:clamp(32px,4.4vw,56px);line-height:1.1;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin-top:18px;max-width:16em}
.lead{color:rgba(255,255,255,.82);font-size:18px;max-width:54ch;margin-top:20px}
.cta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:32px}
.badges{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px 22px;margin-top:34px;font-size:13.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.85)}
.badges span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.badges .ic{color:#7fe3ae}
.q{background:#fff;color:var(--ink);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -28px rgba(0,0,0,.6);overflow:hidden}
.q h3{background:var(--soft);padding:18px 24px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.q h3 small{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink2);margin-top:2px}
.qb{padding:22px 24px 24px;display:grid;gap:14px}
.qb label{display:grid;gap:6px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink2)}
.qb select{font:500 15px var(--t);color:var(--ink);padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);background:#fff;width:100%}
.qb select:focus{border-color:var(--navy)}
.qr{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
.qb .btn{width:100%;margin-top:4px}
.qn{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink2);text-align:center}
/* stats */
.stats{background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.sg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}
@media(max-width:800px){.sg{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
.st{padding:34px 24px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}
.st:last-child{border-right:0}
@media(max-width:800px){.st:nth-child(2){border-right:0}.st:nth-child(-n+2){border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}}
.st b{display:block;font-size:clamp(30px,3.4vw,42px);line-height:1;font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);letter-spacing:-.02em}
.st span{display:block;margin-top:10px;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink2);line-height:1.45}
/* sections */
.sec{padding:clamp(56px,8vw,100px) 0}
.alt{background:var(--soft);border-block:1px solid var(--line)}
.h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3.2vw,40px);line-height:1.15;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--navy);max-width:20em;margin-top:14px}
.sl{color:var(--ink2);font-size:17px;max-width:60ch;margin-top:14px}
.svc{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:44px}
@media(max-width:900px){.svc{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.sv{position:relative;padding:32px 30px 34px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-top:4px solid var(--navy);border-radius:6px}
.sv:nth-child(2){border-top-color:var(--red)}
.sv .no{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--red)}
.sv h3{font-size:21px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin:14px 0 10px;line-height:1.25}
.sv p{font-size:15px;color:var(--ink2)}
.sv ul{margin:16px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none;display:grid;gap:8px;font-size:14.5px}
.sv li{padding-left:18px;position:relative}
.sv li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:.62em;width:7px;height:2px;background:var(--red)}
/* tabs */
.tabs{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:36px}
.tab{font:600 14.5px var(--t);padding:11px 20px;border-radius:var(--r);border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer}
.tab:hover{border-color:var(--navy);color:var(--navy)}
.tab[aria-selected="true"]{background:var(--navy);border-color:var(--navy);color:#fff}
.panel{display:none;margin-top:20px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:30px;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:30px}
.panel.on{display:grid}
@media(max-width:800px){.panel.on{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:22px}}
.panel h3{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy)}
.panel p{margin-top:8px;color:var(--ink2);font-size:15px}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:18px}
.chips span{padding:7px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;font-size:13.5px;background:var(--soft)}
.auth{background:var(--soft);border-left:4px solid var(--red);border-radius:6px;padding:20px 22px;align-self:start}
.auth small{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink2)}
.auth b{display:block;margin-top:8px;font-size:17px;color:var(--navy);line-height:1.35}
.auth span{display:block;margin-top:8px;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink2)}
/* demo */
.dg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,480px);grid-template-areas:"h c" "l c";column-gap:clamp(28px,6vw,72px);row-gap:28px;align-items:start}
.dh{grid-area:h;align-self:end}.dc{grid-area:c;width:100%}
@media(max-width:959px){.dg{grid-template-columns:1fr;grid-template-areas:"h" "c" "l"}.dc,.lc{max-width:480px}}
.chat{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 22px 44px -26px rgba(20,25,43,.4);display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.ct{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:14px 16px;background:var(--navy);color:#fff}
.av{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;color:var(--navy);display:grid;place-items:center}
.ct .n{font-weight:700;font-size:15px}.ct .s{font-size:12px;opacity:.78}
.on2{margin-left:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#bff0d6}
.dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#4ade80}
.cb{height:380px;overflow-y:auto;padding:18px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;background:var(--soft);scrollbar-width:thin}
.bub{max-width:86%;padding:10px 14px;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.5;border-radius:10px;opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px);animation:rise .35s ease forwards;white-space:pre-line}
@keyframes rise{to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
.bub.v{align-self:flex-end;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;border-bottom-right-radius:3px}
.bub.a{align-self:flex-start;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid var(--red);border-bottom-left-radius:3px}
.typing{align-self:flex-start;display:flex;gap:4px;padding:13px 15px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px}
.typing i{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#98a1b8;animation:bl 1.1s infinite}
.typing i:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.15s}.typing i:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.3s}
@keyframes bl{0%,80%,100%{opacity:.25}40%{opacity:1}}
.opts{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;align-self:stretch}
.opts button{text-align:left;font:600 13.5px var(--t);color:var(--navy);background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--navy);border-radius:var(--r);padding:10px 12px;cursor:pointer}
.opts button:hover{background:var(--navy);color:#fff}
.cf{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:11px 13px;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.fi{flex:1;min-width:0;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--soft);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);color:var(--ink2);font-size:14px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.rp{display:none;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:9px 14px;border:1px solid var(--navy);border-radius:var(--r);background:#fff;color:var(--navy);font:700 12.5px var(--t);cursor:pointer}
.rp:hover{background:var(--navy);color:#fff}
.lc{grid-area:l;width:100%;max-width:400px;opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);transition:opacity .5s,transform .7s ease}
.lc.sh{opacity:1;transform:none}
.lcard{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-top:4px solid var(--red);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden}
.lh{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:13px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink2)}
.lh b{color:var(--navy)}
.lr{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:10px 18px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.lr span:first-child{color:var(--ink2);font-weight:500}
.ls{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:12px 18px;background:#e9f6ef;color:var(--green);font-size:13.5px;font-weight:700}
/* table */
.tw{margin-top:40px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:#fff;overflow:auto}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:15px;min-width:560px}
th{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;text-align:left;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:14px 20px;font-weight:700}
td{padding:16px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}
tr:last-child td{border-bottom:0}
td:first-child{font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);width:34%}
td:last-child{color:var(--ink2)}
.note{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink2);margin-top:12px}
/* steps */
.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px;margin:44px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none;counter-reset:s}
@media(max-width:860px){.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
@media(max-width:520px){.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.step{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:26px 24px}
.node{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:8px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:16px}
.step:last-child .node{background:var(--red)}
.step h3{font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin:16px 0 6px}
.step p{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink2);line-height:1.55}
/* faq */
.faq{margin-top:36px;display:grid;gap:10px;max-width:860px}
details{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px}
summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;padding:18px 22px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;align-items:center}
summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
summary::after{content:"+";font-size:22px;line-height:1;color:var(--red);font-weight:600}
details[open] summary::after{content:"−"}
details[open] summary{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
details p{padding:16px 22px 20px;color:var(--ink2);font-size:15px}
/* band */
.band{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;border-top:4px solid var(--red)}
.bg2{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:28px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:clamp(40px,5vw,60px) 0}
.band h2{font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,34px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.015em;max-width:20em;line-height:1.2}
.band p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);margin-top:10px;max-width:52ch}
.band .cta{margin:0}
/* footer */
.mf{background:var(--navy3);color:#fff;padding:0 0 calc(110px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px))}
.mft{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 2.1fr;gap:clamp(28px,5vw,64px);padding:clamp(44px,6vw,70px) 0 40px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16)}
@media(max-width:900px){.mft{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.plate{background:#fff;padding:16px 22px;display:inline-block;border-radius:8px;border-bottom:3px solid var(--red)}
.plate img{height:52px;width:auto}
.mfb p{margin-top:20px;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,.78);max-width:36ch}
.mfc{margin-top:22px;display:grid;gap:12px;font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.92)}
.mfc div{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}
.mfc .ic{margin-top:4px;color:#ff8a82}
.mfg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:clamp(22px,3vw,40px)}
@media(max-width:700px){.mfg{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
@media(max-width:440px){.mfg{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.mfg h4{margin:0 0 16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--red);display:inline-block}
.mfg ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:9px}
.mfg li{position:relative;padding-left:16px;font-size:14.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.82);line-height:1.4}
.mfg li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:.6em;width:6px;height:6px;background:var(--red);border-radius:1px}
.mfs{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;padding:28px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16)}
.mfs span{padding:8px 16px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);border-radius:999px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:500}
.mfs span:nth-child(3n){border-color:rgba(255,138,130,.6)}
.mfd{padding-top:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;font-size:12.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.68);line-height:1.6}
.mfd b{color:#fff;font-weight:600}
/* floating chat */
.fl{position:fixed;z-index:60;right:calc(18px + env(safe-area-inset-right,0px));bottom:calc(18px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px));display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;gap:12px;max-width:calc(100% - 28px)}
.fp{width:min(380px,100vw - 28px);display:none;box-shadow:0 24px 60px -20px rgba(20,25,43,.5)}
.fp.open{display:flex}
.fp .cb{height:min(360px,48vh)}
.fb{width:58px;height:58px;border:0;border-radius:16px;cursor:pointer;background:var(--red);color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;box-shadow:0 12px 30px -10px rgba(224,43,32,.7)}
.fb:hover{background:var(--red2)}
.fb .ic{width:26px;height:26px}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.typing i{animation:none}.lc,.bub{transition:none;animation:none;opacity:1;transform:none}html{scroll-behavior:auto}.btn:hover{transform:none}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute" aria-hidden="true">
<symbol id="i-doc" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 3h8l4 4v14H6z"/><path d="M14 3v4h4M9 12h6M9 16h6"/></symbol>
<symbol id="i-chat" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 5h16v11H9l-5 4z"/></symbol>
<symbol id="i-replay" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 3-6.7"/><path d="M3 4v5h5"/></symbol>
<symbol id="i-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></symbol>
<symbol id="i-bolt" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M13 2L5 14h6l-1 8 8-12h-6z"/></symbol>
<symbol id="i-pin" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 21s7-6 7-12a7 7 0 0 0-14 0c0 6 7 12 7 12z"/><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="2.5"/></symbol>
<symbol id="i-mail" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 5h18v14H3z"/><path d="M3 6l9 7 9-7"/></symbol>
<symbol id="i-phone" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 4h4l2 5-2.5 1.5a11 11 0 0 0 5 5L15 13l5 2v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A15 15 0 0 1 3 6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z"/></symbol>
<symbol id="i-check" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></symbol>
</svg>

<div class="strip"><b>Демонстрационна страница от Hackera</b> · не е официален сайт на агенция „АПОСТИЛ“</div>
<div class="util"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="l"><span><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-pin"/></svg>гр. София, ул. „Пиротска“ № 8</span><span><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-mail"/></svg>office.prevodibg@gmail.com</span></div>
  <div class="r"><span><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-phone"/></svg>+359 896 333 329</span><span><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-phone"/></svg>+359 875 152 150</span></div>
</div></div>

<header class="hd" id="top"><div class="wrap">
  <a href="#top" aria-label="АПОСТИЛ ЕООД"><img src="https://prevodi-bg.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/apostille1-logo.png" alt="Apostille, АПОСТИЛ ЕООД" width="511" height="185"></a>
  <ul class="nl"><li><a href="#work">Услуги</a></li><li><a href="#docs">Документи</a></li><li><a href="#demo">AI асистент</a></li><li><a href="#auth">Апостил</a></li><li><a href="#faq">Въпроси</a></li></ul>
  <a class="btn b1" href="#quote">Бърза заявка</a>
</div></header>

<section class="hero"><div class="wrap hg">
  <div>
    <span class="eb">Преводи и легализация</span>
    <h1>Официални преводи и легализация на документи</h1>
